---
// Self-contained SVG+CSS transit animation. No JS, no video, no external requests.
// A planet crosses its star; the brightness trace below dips in sync.
---

<div class="transit" role="img" aria-label="Animation: a planet crosses in front of its star, and the star's brightness dips at the same moment.">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 520 260" class="transit-svg">
    <defs>
      <radialGradient id="starGlow">
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#fff6d8" />
        <stop offset="45%" stop-color="#ffd166" />
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#ff9e3d" />
      </radialGradient>
      <radialGradient id="halo">
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="rgba(255,209,102,0.45)" />
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgba(255,209,102,0)" />
      </radialGradient>
    </defs>

    <circle cx="150" cy="80" r="72" fill="url(#halo)" class="halo" />
    <circle cx="150" cy="80" r="46" fill="url(#starGlow)" class="star" />
    <circle cx="0" cy="80" r="13" fill="#10131a" class="planet" />

    <line x1="40" y1="200" x2="490" y2="200" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.14)" stroke-width="1" />
    <text x="40" y="228" class="axis">brightness we measure</text>

    <path d="M40 180 L112 180 Q132 180 140 199 L176 199 Q184 180 204 180 L490 180"
          fill="none" stroke="#4fd1ff" stroke-width="2.5"
          stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="trace" />
  </svg>

  <p class="transit-caption">
    Watch the line. When the planet slides in front, the star gets a tiny bit dimmer &mdash;
    and that little dip is the only thing we actually see from here.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .transit {
    margin: 2rem auto 2.5rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, #131922 0%, #0b0d12 70%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(79, 209, 255, 0.22);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .transit-svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

  .axis {
    fill: #7d8894;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .planet { animation: cross 7s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes cross {
    0%   { transform: translateX(20px); }
    100% { transform: translateX(520px); }
  }

  .star { animation: dim 7s linear infinite; transform-origin: 150px 80px; }
  @keyframes dim {
    0%, 22%   { opacity: 1; }
    30%, 40%  { opacity: 0.82; }
    48%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
  }

  .halo { animation: pulse 7s linear infinite; transform-origin: 150px 80px; }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 22%   { opacity: 0.9; }
    30%, 40%  { opacity: 0.6; }
    48%, 100% { opacity: 0.9; }
  }

  .trace {
    stroke-dasharray: 520;
    stroke-dashoffset: 520;
    animation: draw 7s linear infinite;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(79, 209, 255, 0.55));
  }
  @keyframes draw {
    0%   { stroke-dashoffset: 520; }
    92%  { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    100% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
  }

  .transit-caption {
    color: #9aa6b2;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .planet, .star, .halo, .trace { animation: none; }
    .trace { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    .planet { transform: translateX(150px); }
  }
</style>
